# Odin III's Phase 3 opt script (3G spec WR-9, Parmys synthesis.tcl lines 1-4, 6, 7 and 9 without
# peepopt and share: Phase 4; flatten, memory -nomap and hardmap are other passes). `wreduce` runs
# before `flatten` as in Parmys. `opt` never compacts (IR-6 unchanged): the script compacts last.
opt_expr
opt_clean
opt -nodffe -nosdff
proc
opt
wreduce
opt_clean
opt -full
compact
